      <description><![CDATA[<p style="float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;"><img src="https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/2026/10/01M3TG0M8S1BAV7KN2AJ34JJE9/prediction-market.jpg" alt="US lawmakers propose up to 30% rewards for prediction market whistleblowers" class="type:primaryImage"></p><p>Whistleblowers could receive 10% to 30% of monetary sanctions in qualifying prediction market fraud cases exceeding $1 million in penalties. </p>]]></description>
